    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Inquiry privacy notice</h1>
    <p class="lede">Hii collects only the information you choose to provide so we can understand and respond to your inquiry.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="section-shell inquiry-form-section" aria-labelledby="privacy-details-heading">
    <div class="inquiry-form-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Public inquiry forms</p>
      <h2 id="privacy-details-heading">How submitted information is handled</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="privacy-notice-copy">
      <p>Information submitted through an Hii inquiry form is transmitted through Hii’s website hosting provider and made available to Hii for the purpose of reviewing and responding to the inquiry.</p>
      <p>Do not submit confidential, patient-identifying, protected health, crisis, or emergency information. Hii’s forms are not clinical-support or emergency channels.</p>
      <p>Hii does not use inquiry information to provide diagnosis, treatment, crisis support, or individualized clinical guidance. Access is limited to people working on the relevant Hii response or program.</p>
      <p>To ask about information you submitted or request its deletion, contact <a href="mailto:staceymoe@hii.earth?subject=Inquiry%20privacy%20request">staceymoe@hii.earth</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>
